Software Center arrives. It is an FLTK app with a System Update tab that
shows the running kernel and this ROM's version, lists every update
installed with it, and can install a piko.tar package picked from the SD
card without touching a shell.

--
Earlier ROMs predate this file, so their manifests carry no changelog.
Everything above the "--" line is what ships as the current entry; add a
new paragraph at the top for each release and push the old one below it.
Blank lines separate entries. Keep each one to a single short paragraph:
it is read on a 640x480 screen, in a scrolling box, by someone deciding
whether to install.
